## 3. End-to-End Workflow — Page Specs

### Workflow Overview

```
Step 1: Create RFQ
  → Step 2: Supplier Quotes
    → Step 3: Compare & Score
      → Step 4: Internal Approval
        → Step 5: Award Supplier
          → Step 6: Generate PO
            → Step 7: Send PO
```

