## 8. Mobile Responsiveness Strategy

| Breakpoint     | Layout                                                    |
|----------------|-----------------------------------------------------------|
| `≥1024px`      | Full sidebar + multi-column layouts                       |
| `768px–1023px` | Collapsed sidebar (icons only), 2-col → 1-col            |
| `<768px`       | Bottom nav bar, card-based lists, slide-up modals, FAB    |

**Mobile-specific patterns:**
- Tables → card stacks with key info + expandable details
- Multi-step forms → full-screen steps with progress bar at top
- Comparison matrix → horizontal scroll with sticky first column
- Approval actions → floating action bar (Approve / Reject / Return)
- Modals → slide up from bottom, full-width

